# Bazel
bazel-*
# //bazel:vendor_deps.bzl vendors ThirdParty/ submodules via local_repository
# using each checkout's absolute path (so it works whether this repo is built
# standalone or nested inside another workspace). Bazel's module-extension
# lock caching does not re-run the extension when its declared inputs are
# unchanged, so a committed MODULE.bazel.lock replays the absolute path from
# whichever machine last regenerated it — breaking the build on every other
# machine/CI runner. Never commit it; let each environment regenerate its own.
MODULE.bazel.lock

